  "job_B15.8.645_20260920_210347": {
    "text": "\u00c6rest of usmere on heasecan beorh.\nOf \u00feam beorge on cu\u00f0redes treow.\nOf \u00feam treowe on \u00fea dic.\nAndlang dic \u00fe\u00e6t on sture.\n\u00deonne of sture \u00f0\u00e6t eft on \u00fea dic.\nAndlang dic \u00fe\u00e6t on horsa broc, andlang broces on cenunga ford.\nOf \u00fean forda utan wi\u00f0 \u00feone wudu \u00f0\u00e6t to kyne fares stane.\nOf \u00fean stane on hoccan stige.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re stige on m\u00e6r wylle.\nOf \u00f0am wylle on \u00f0a dic, andlang dic on sture.\nOf sture on m\u00e6r dene.\nAndlang dene to windofre.\nOf windofre on \u00f0one stapul, of \u00feam stapole on \u00feone weg.\nAndlang weges in \u00f0\u00e6t sl\u00e6d.\nOf \u00feam sl\u00e6de on lyttan dune.\nAndlang weges \u00fe\u00e6t eft on us mere.",
